  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h2 data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"169\" id=\"isPasted\">🥊 TEKXYZ Reflex Ball – The Ultimate Boxing Training Tool</h2><h3 data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"197\">• Brand Introduction</h3><p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"478\"><strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"208\">TEKXYZ</strong> is a fitness and boxing training brand dedicated to helping people improve reflexes, hand-eye coordination, and focus through fun, effective tools. Trusted by thousands worldwide, TEKXYZ combines innovation and accessibility to bring pro-level training into every home.</p><h3 data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"512\" id=\"isPasted\">• Product Description</h3><p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"642\">Level up your training with the <strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"571\">TEKXYZ Reflex Ball Kit</strong> – a complete reaction training solution for all ages and skill levels.</p><p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"657\"><strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"657\">Includes:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"826\"><li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"704\"><p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"704\">1 adjustable headband (fits adults and kids)</p></li><li data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"761\"><p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"761\">4 reflex balls (4 difficulty levels – beginner to pro)</p></li><li data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"795\"><p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"795\">Extra replacement elastic cords</p></li><li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"826\"><p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"826\">Carry pouch &amp; training guide</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1016\">Whether you're a boxer, MMA athlete, or just looking for a fun way to get active, this kit helps boost your speed, agility, and coordination – all without needing gloves or expensive gear.</p><p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1016\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1055\" id=\"isPasted\">• USP (Unique Selling Point)</h3><p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1470\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1086\">Progressive Difficulty:</strong> 4 balls with different rebound speeds for beginner to pro<br data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1165\">Safe &amp; Soft:</strong> Lightweight foam balls – safe for kids, no gloves needed<br data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1225\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1246\">Train Anywhere:</strong> Compact, no equipment needed – perfect for home, office, or gym<br data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1313\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1338\">Fun for the Family:</strong> Great interactive workout that’s also entertaining<br data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1423\">Build Discipline &amp; Focus:</strong> Ideal for athletes, students, and gamers alike</p><p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1470\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1496\" id=\"isPasted\">• Payment Terms</h3><ul data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1826\"><li data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1550\"><p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1550\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1520\">Retail Price:</strong> From $19.99 (varies by set)</p></li><li data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1647\"><p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1647\">💳 <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1576\">Payment Methods:</strong> Visa, MasterCard, PayPal, Apple Pay, Klarna (on supported platforms)</p></li><li data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1721\"><p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1721\">🔁 <strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1671\">Return Policy:</strong> 30-day money-back guarantee for unused products</p></li><li data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1826\"><p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1826\">🚚 <strong data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1740\">Shipping:</strong> Worldwide shipping available with tracking (2–10 business days depending on location)</p></li></ul><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1856\" id=\"isPasted\">• Other Information</h3><ul data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"2097\"><li data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1908\"><p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1908\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1882\">Packaging Size:</strong> ~5.1 x 3.5 x 2.7 inches</p></li><li data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1949\"><p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1949\">⚖️ <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1933\">Product Weight:</strong> ~30g per ball</p></li><li data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2016\"><p data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2016\">👶 <strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1975\">Recommended Age:</strong> 8+ (suitable for both kids and adults)</p></li><li data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2097\"><p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2097\">🛑 <strong data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2034\">Caution:</strong> Use in open space. Avoid near ceiling fans or fragile objects.</p></li></ul><p><br></p></div></div>",
